# enable crashpad
if you want to use crashpad subsystem, you can do as follow:
1. set build arg `enable_crashpad` to true in crashpad.gni
or
2. set build arg `enable_crashpad` to true in build.sh

# parse dmp
1. you can get dmp file from `[path to package]\files\chromium\Crash Reports\pending`
2. you can parse dmp as the url: `https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/harmonyos-guides/web-crashpad-V5`
